flowchart TB
    accTitle: The reply to a discussion
    accDescr: Someone other than the maintainer or a bot opens a discussion or comments on one. A discussion of the maintainer, and one whose answer was chosen, end there. Otherwise the pager shows it in its topic and asks the control repository for a draft at once, which Claude writes in the maintainer's voice. The draft comes with Send, Edit and Ignore. Send posts exactly that draft as the pager's app, in the thread of the comment that it answers, or on the discussion itself. A new comment of someone else makes itself the message to answer, with a new draft, in the same topic, while a text that the maintainer wrote themselves stays the draft. When the maintainer replies on GitHub itself, an answer is marked, or the discussion is closed, the thing is done: its buttons go, and its topic gets a check mark.

    asked["`**💬** Someone else opens a discussion or comments on one`"]
    quiet["`A discussion of the maintainer, or one with its answer chosen: nothing happens`"]
    shown["The pager shows it in its topic and asks the control repository for a draft"]
    draft["`**✍️** Claude drafts a reply in the maintainer's voice: ✅ Send, ✏️ Edit, ✖ Ignore`"]
    press["The maintainer presses ✅ Send, or edits the draft first: their own text stays the draft"]
    reply["`**✅** The app posts exactly that draft, in the thread of the comment that it answers`"]
    ended["`**✅** The maintainer replies on GitHub, an answer is marked, or the discussion closes: the thing is done, without buttons`"]

    asked -- "the maintainer's, or answered" --> quiet
    asked -- "anyone else's" --> shown --> draft --> press --> reply
    reply -- "a new comment of someone else: a new draft, in the same topic" --> shown
    draft -- "dealt with on GitHub" --> ended

    classDef you fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class asked,press you
    class quiet,shown,draft bot
    class reply,ended done
